{"seq":3,"slug":"multi-monitor-workflow","title":"多显示器与工作流编排","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-systems/developer-toolbox/workspace-productivity/multi-monitor-workflow","wordCount":1022,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"多显示器与工作流编排\">多显示器与工作流编排</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>多显示器环境为开发者提供了更大的视觉空间，但如果不加以规划，反而会导致窗口散乱、注意力分散。真正高效的多显示器工作流不是简单地&quot;把窗口铺开&quot;，而是将物理屏幕空间与心智模型对齐——让每个屏幕承载特定的职责角色，结合工作区预设和自动化规则，实现&quot;切换任务时无需手动重排窗口&quot;的无摩擦体验。</p>\n<p>本文讨论多显示器的空间分配策略、基于任务场景的工作区预设、与 Focus Mode 的联动，以及如何将布局方案纳入 dotfiles 实现跨设备一致性。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><h3 id=\"屏幕角色分配模型\">屏幕角色分配模型</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph M[&quot;主显示器 - 生产&quot;]&#10;        E[&quot;编辑器/终端&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph S[&quot;副显示器 - 参考&quot;]&#10;        B[&quot;浏览器/文档&quot;]&#10;        C[&quot;通讯/监控&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    M --- S\">graph LR\n    subgraph M[\"主显示器 - 生产\"]\n        E[\"编辑器/终端\"]\n    end\n    subgraph S[\"副显示器 - 参考\"]\n        B[\"浏览器/文档\"]\n        C[\"通讯/监控\"]\n    end\n    M --- S</pre><p>三种经典模型：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模型</th>\n<th>主屏</th>\n<th>副屏</th>\n<th>适合场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>生产+参考</td>\n<td>编辑器/终端</td>\n<td>浏览器/文档</td>\n<td>日常编码</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>生产+通讯</td>\n<td>编辑器/终端</td>\n<td>Slack/邮件/监控面板</td>\n<td>远程协作</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>生产+预览</td>\n<td>编辑器</td>\n<td>浏览器实时预览/模拟器</td>\n<td>前端/移动开发</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"工作区预设概念\">工作区预设概念</h3><p>工作区预设（Workspace Preset）是一组预定义的窗口布局，可以一键切换。不同任务场景使用不同预设：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>预设名称</th>\n<th>主屏布局</th>\n<th>副屏布局</th>\n<th>触发方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Coding</td>\n<td>终端(左)+编辑器(右)</td>\n<td>浏览器全屏</td>\n<td>Hyper+F1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Review</td>\n<td>编辑器(全屏)</td>\n<td>Git diff+PR 页面</td>\n<td>Hyper+F2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Meeting</td>\n<td>视频会议(全屏)</td>\n<td>笔记+日历</td>\n<td>Hyper+F3</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Writing</td>\n<td>Obsidian(全屏)</td>\n<td>参考资料</td>\n<td>Hyper+F4</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"macos-多显示器行为\">macOS 多显示器行为</h3><p>macOS 对多显示器的默认行为需要了解和调优：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Displays have separate Spaces</strong>（推荐开启）：每个显示器独立管理工作区</li>\n<li><strong>Stage Manager</strong>：macOS 14+ 的窗口分组功能，与平铺管理器可能冲突</li>\n<li><strong>显示器排列</strong>：System Settings &gt; Displays &gt; Arrangement</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"实战指南\">实战指南</h2><h3 id=\"aerospace-多显示器配置\">Aerospace 多显示器配置</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"toml\" data-code=\"# ~/.aerospace.toml — 多显示器部分&#10;&#10;# 每个显示器独立工作区&#10;# 主显示器: 工作区 1-5&#10;# 副显示器: 工作区 6-9&#10;&#10;[mode.main.binding]&#10;# 主显示器工作区&#10;alt-1 = &#39;workspace 1&#39;&#10;alt-2 = &#39;workspace 2&#39;&#10;alt-3 = &#39;workspace 3&#39;&#10;&#10;# 副显示器工作区&#10;alt-7 = &#39;workspace 7&#39;&#10;alt-8 = &#39;workspace 8&#39;&#10;alt-9 = &#39;workspace 9&#39;&#10;&#10;# 焦点在显示器间切换&#10;alt-tab = &#39;focus-monitor --wrap-around next&#39;&#10;&#10;# 窗口在显示器间移动&#10;alt-shift-tab = &#39;move-node-to-monitor --wrap-around next&#39;&#10;&#10;# === 应用绑定到特定工作区 ===&#10;[[on-window-detected]]&#10;if.app-id = &#39;com.mitchellh.ghostty&#39;&#10;run = [&#39;move-node-to-workspace 1&#39;]&#10;&#10;[[on-window-detected]]&#10;if.app-id = &#39;com.microsoft.VSCode&#39;&#10;run = [&#39;move-node-to-workspace 2&#39;]&#10;&#10;[[on-window-detected]]&#10;if.app-id = &#39;org.mozilla.firefox&#39;&#10;run = [&#39;move-node-to-workspace 7&#39;]&#10;&#10;[[on-window-detected]]&#10;if.app-id = &#39;com.tinyspeck.slackmacgap&#39;&#10;run = [&#39;move-node-to-workspace 8&#39;]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># ~/.aerospace.toml — 多显示器部分</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 每个显示器独立工作区</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 主显示器: 工作区 1-5</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 副显示器: 工作区 6-9</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[mode.main.binding]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 主显示器工作区</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>alt-1 = 'workspace 1'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>alt-2 = 'workspace 2'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>alt-3 = 'workspace 3'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 副显示器工作区</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>alt-7 = 'workspace 7'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>alt-8 = 'workspace 8'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>alt-9 = 'workspace 9'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 焦点在显示器间切换</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>alt-tab = 'focus-monitor --wrap-around next'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 窗口在显示器间移动</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>alt-shift-tab = 'move-node-to-monitor --wrap-around next'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># === 应用绑定到特定工作区 ===</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[[on-window-detected]]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>if.app-id = 'com.mitchellh.ghostty'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>run = ['move-node-to-workspace 1']</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[[on-window-detected]]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>if.app-id = 'com.microsoft.VSCode'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>run = ['move-node-to-workspace 2']</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[[on-window-detected]]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>if.app-id = 'org.mozilla.firefox'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>run = ['move-node-to-workspace 7']</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[[on-window-detected]]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>if.app-id = 'com.tinyspeck.slackmacgap'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>run = ['move-node-to-workspace 8']</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"hammerspoon-工作区预设\">Hammerspoon 工作区预设</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"lua\" data-code=\"-- ~/.hammerspoon/init.lua — 工作区预设&#10;&#10;local hyper = {&quot;ctrl&quot;, &quot;alt&quot;, &quot;cmd&quot;, &quot;shift&quot;}&#10;&#10;-- 获取屏幕&#10;local function getScreens()&#10;    local screens = hs.screen.allScreens()&#10;    return {&#10;        main = screens[1],&#10;        secondary = screens[2] or screens[1]&#10;    }&#10;end&#10;&#10;-- 预设：编码模式&#10;hs.hotkey.bind(hyper, &quot;F1&quot;, function()&#10;    local s = getScreens()&#10;    local mainFrame = s.main:frame()&#10;    local secFrame = s.secondary:frame()&#10;&#10;    -- 主屏：终端左半 + 编辑器右半&#10;    local ghostty = hs.application.find(&quot;Ghostty&quot;)&#10;    if ghostty then&#10;        local win = ghostty:mainWindow()&#10;        if win then&#10;            win:moveToScreen(s.main)&#10;            win:setFrame({&#10;                x = mainFrame.x,&#10;                y = mainFrame.y,&#10;                w = mainFrame.w * 0.4,&#10;                h = mainFrame.h&#10;            })&#10;        end&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    local vscode = hs.application.find(&quot;Code&quot;)&#10;    if vscode then&#10;        local win = vscode:mainWindow()&#10;        if win then&#10;            win:moveToScreen(s.main)&#10;            win:setFrame({&#10;                x = mainFrame.x + mainFrame.w * 0.4,&#10;                y = mainFrame.y,&#10;                w = mainFrame.w * 0.6,&#10;                h = mainFrame.h&#10;            })&#10;        end&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    -- 副屏：浏览器全屏&#10;    local firefox = hs.application.find(&quot;Firefox&quot;)&#10;    if firefox then&#10;        local win = firefox:mainWindow()&#10;        if win then&#10;            win:moveToScreen(s.secondary)&#10;            win:maximize()&#10;        end&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    hs.notify.new({title=&quot;Workspace&quot;, informativeText=&quot;Coding mode activated&quot;}):send()&#10;end)&#10;&#10;-- 预设：会议模式&#10;hs.hotkey.bind(hyper, &quot;F3&quot;, function()&#10;    local s = getScreens()&#10;&#10;    -- 主屏：视频会议最大化&#10;    local zoom = hs.application.find(&quot;zoom.us&quot;) or hs.application.find(&quot;Feishu&quot;)&#10;    if zoom then&#10;        local win = zoom:mainWindow()&#10;        if win then&#10;            win:moveToScreen(s.main)&#10;            win:maximize()&#10;        end&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    -- 副屏：笔记&#10;    local obsidian = hs.application.find(&quot;Obsidian&quot;)&#10;    if obsidian then&#10;        local win = obsidian:mainWindow()&#10;        if win then&#10;            win:moveToScreen(s.secondary)&#10;            win:maximize()&#10;        end&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    hs.notify.new({title=&quot;Workspace&quot;, informativeText=&quot;Meeting mode activated&quot;}):send()&#10;end)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>-- ~/.hammerspoon/init.lua — 工作区预设</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>local hyper = {\"ctrl\", \"alt\", \"cmd\", \"shift\"}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- 获取屏幕</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>local function getScreens()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    local screens = hs.screen.allScreens()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        main = screens[1],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        secondary = screens[2] or screens[1]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>end</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- 预设：编码模式</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>hs.hotkey.bind(hyper, \"F1\", function()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    local s = getScreens()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    local mainFrame = s.main:frame()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    local secFrame = s.secondary:frame()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    -- 主屏：终端左半 + 编辑器右半</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    local ghostty = hs.application.find(\"Ghostty\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if ghostty then</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        local win = ghostty:mainWindow()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if win then</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            win:moveToScreen(s.main)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            win:setFrame({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                x = mainFrame.x,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                y = mainFrame.y,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                w = mainFrame.w * 0.4,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                h = mainFrame.h</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            })</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        end</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    end</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    local vscode = hs.application.find(\"Code\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if vscode then</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        local win = vscode:mainWindow()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if win then</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            win:moveToScreen(s.main)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            win:setFrame({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                x = mainFrame.x + mainFrame.w * 0.4,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                y = mainFrame.y,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                w = mainFrame.w * 0.6,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                h = mainFrame.h</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            })</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        end</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    end</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    -- 副屏：浏览器全屏</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    local firefox = hs.application.find(\"Firefox\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if firefox then</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        local win = firefox:mainWindow()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if win then</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            win:moveToScreen(s.secondary)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            win:maximize()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        end</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    end</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    hs.notify.new({title=\"Workspace\", informativeText=\"Coding mode activated\"}):send()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>end)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- 预设：会议模式</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>hs.hotkey.bind(hyper, \"F3\", function()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    local s = getScreens()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    -- 主屏：视频会议最大化</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    local zoom = hs.application.find(\"zoom.us\") or hs.application.find(\"Feishu\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if zoom then</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        local win = zoom:mainWindow()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if win then</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            win:moveToScreen(s.main)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            win:maximize()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        end</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    end</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    -- 副屏：笔记</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    local obsidian = hs.application.find(\"Obsidian\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if obsidian then</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        local win = obsidian:mainWindow()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if win then</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            win:moveToScreen(s.secondary)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            win:maximize()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        end</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    end</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    hs.notify.new({title=\"Workspace\", informativeText=\"Meeting mode activated\"}):send()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>end)</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"focus-mode-联动\">Focus Mode 联动</h3><p>macOS Focus Mode 可以根据场景自动切换通知过滤，与工作区预设联动效果更佳：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"lua\" data-code=\"-- Hammerspoon: 切换预设时同步 Focus Mode&#10;-- 注意：macOS Focus 需要通过 Shortcuts.app 来程序化切换&#10;&#10;-- 方案：使用 shortcuts CLI&#10;local function setFocusMode(mode)&#10;    -- 需要先在 Shortcuts.app 中创建对应快捷指令&#10;    hs.execute(&quot;shortcuts run &#39;Set Focus &quot; .. mode .. &quot;&#39;&quot;, true)&#10;end&#10;&#10;hs.hotkey.bind(hyper, &quot;F1&quot;, function()&#10;    -- ... 布局代码 ...&#10;    setFocusMode(&quot;Coding&quot;)  -- 静音非紧急通知&#10;end)&#10;&#10;hs.hotkey.bind(hyper, &quot;F3&quot;, function()&#10;    -- ... 布局代码 ...&#10;    setFocusMode(&quot;Meeting&quot;)  -- 静音所有通知&#10;end)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>-- Hammerspoon: 切换预设时同步 Focus Mode</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- 注意：macOS Focus 需要通过 Shortcuts.app 来程序化切换</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- 方案：使用 shortcuts CLI</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>local function setFocusMode(mode)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    -- 需要先在 Shortcuts.app 中创建对应快捷指令</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    hs.execute(\"shortcuts run 'Set Focus \" .. mode .. \"'\", true)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>end</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>hs.hotkey.bind(hyper, \"F1\", function()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    -- ... 布局代码 ...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    setFocusMode(\"Coding\")  -- 静音非紧急通知</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>end)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>hs.hotkey.bind(hyper, \"F3\", function()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    -- ... 布局代码 ...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    setFocusMode(\"Meeting\")  -- 静音所有通知</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>end)</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"单显示器最佳实践\">单显示器最佳实践</h3><p>不是每个人都有多显示器。单显示器的效率策略：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"toml\" data-code=\"# Aerospace 单显示器策略&#10;&#10;# 充分利用多工作区（替代多显示器的物理空间）&#10;[mode.main.binding]&#10;alt-1 = &#39;workspace 1&#39;  # 编码&#10;alt-2 = &#39;workspace 2&#39;  # 浏览器&#10;alt-3 = &#39;workspace 3&#39;  # 通讯&#10;alt-4 = &#39;workspace 4&#39;  # 文档&#10;&#10;# 快速在两个最近工作区间切换&#10;alt-tab = &#39;workspace-back-and-forth&#39;&#10;&#10;# Split view（单屏最重要的布局）&#10;alt-slash = &#39;layout tiles horizontal vertical&#39;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># Aerospace 单显示器策略</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 充分利用多工作区（替代多显示器的物理空间）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[mode.main.binding]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>alt-1 = 'workspace 1'  # 编码</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>alt-2 = 'workspace 2'  # 浏览器</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>alt-3 = 'workspace 3'  # 通讯</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>alt-4 = 'workspace 4'  # 文档</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 快速在两个最近工作区间切换</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>alt-tab = 'workspace-back-and-forth'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># Split view（单屏最重要的布局）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>alt-slash = 'layout tiles horizontal vertical'</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"最佳实践\">最佳实践</h2><h3 id=\"显示器选购建议-开发者视角\">显示器选购建议（开发者视角）</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>需求</th>\n<th>推荐规格</th>\n<th>原因</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>主力编码</td>\n<td>27&quot; 4K 或 32&quot; 4K</td>\n<td>完整代码视野，字体清晰</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>副屏参考</td>\n<td>24&quot; 4K 竖屏</td>\n<td>文档/PR/日志天然适合竖屏</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>极致沉浸</td>\n<td>34&quot; 超宽 (21:9)</td>\n<td>左右分屏等于两个显示器</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>移动办公</td>\n<td>便携显示器 15.6&quot;</td>\n<td>随 MacBook 出差也有双屏</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"竖屏使用场景\">竖屏使用场景</h3><p>将副屏旋转 90° 特别适合：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>阅读长文档/代码 PR</li>\n<li>查看日志输出</li>\n<li>Slack/通讯应用</li>\n<li>终端的长输出</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"布局方案版本控制\">布局方案版本控制</h3><p>将窗口管理配置纳入 dotfiles：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"~/dotfiles/&#10;├── aerospace/&#10;│   └── .aerospace.toml        # Aerospace 配置&#10;├── hammerspoon/&#10;│   └── .hammerspoon/&#10;│       ├── init.lua           # 主配置&#10;│       ├── workspaces.lua     # 工作区预设&#10;│       └── helpers.lua        # 工具函数&#10;└── karabiner/&#10;    └── .config/karabiner/&#10;        └── karabiner.json     # 按键映射\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>~/dotfiles/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── aerospace/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   └── .aerospace.toml        # Aerospace 配置</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── hammerspoon/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   └── .hammerspoon/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│       ├── init.lua           # 主配置</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│       ├── workspaces.lua     # 工作区预设</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│       └── helpers.lua        # 工具函数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>└── karabiner/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    └── .config/karabiner/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        └── karabiner.json     # 按键映射</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"环境感知自动切换\">环境感知自动切换</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"lua\" data-code=\"-- 根据连接的显示器数量自动调整布局&#10;local function handleScreenChange()&#10;    local screenCount = #hs.screen.allScreens()&#10;&#10;    if screenCount == 1 then&#10;        -- 单屏模式：工作区策略&#10;        hs.notify.new({title=&quot;Display&quot;, informativeText=&quot;Single display mode&quot;}):send()&#10;    elseif screenCount == 2 then&#10;        -- 双屏模式：应用预设布局&#10;        hs.notify.new({title=&quot;Display&quot;, informativeText=&quot;Dual display mode&quot;}):send()&#10;        -- 自动触发 Coding preset&#10;    end&#10;end&#10;&#10;hs.screen.watcher.new(handleScreenChange):start()\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>-- 根据连接的显示器数量自动调整布局</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>local function handleScreenChange()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    local screenCount = #hs.screen.allScreens()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if screenCount == 1 then</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        -- 单屏模式：工作区策略</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        hs.notify.new({title=\"Display\", informativeText=\"Single display mode\"}):send()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    elseif screenCount == 2 then</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        -- 双屏模式：应用预设布局</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        hs.notify.new({title=\"Display\", informativeText=\"Dual display mode\"}):send()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        -- 自动触发 Coding preset</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    end</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>end</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>hs.screen.watcher.new(handleScreenChange):start()</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"工具与生态\">工具与生态</h2><h3 id=\"显示器管理工具\">显示器管理工具</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>工具</th>\n<th>功能</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>MonitorControl</strong></td>\n<td>外接显示器亮度/对比度控制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>BetterDisplay</strong></td>\n<td>自定义分辨率、HDR 控制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>DisplayLink Manager</strong></td>\n<td>USB 显示器驱动</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Lunar</strong></td>\n<td>智能亮度调节</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"工作流编排参考\">工作流编排参考</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>推荐布局</th>\n<th>工具组合</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>全栈开发</td>\n<td>主屏: 编辑器+终端, 副屏: 浏览器</td>\n<td>Aerospace + Ghostty</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Code Review</td>\n<td>主屏: diff 全屏, 副屏: 源码浏览</td>\n<td>自动预设切换</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>写作</td>\n<td>主屏: 编辑器全屏, 副屏: 大纲+参考</td>\n<td>Focus Mode: Writing</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>调试</td>\n<td>主屏: 调试器+日志, 副屏: 源码</td>\n<td>调试预设</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"总结\">总结</h2><p>多显示器工作流的核心不是&quot;更多像素&quot;而是&quot;更清晰的空间语义&quot;。将每个屏幕（或工作区）赋予明确的职责角色，配合自动化的窗口规则和预设切换，可以实现&quot;任务切换时环境自动跟随&quot;的流畅体验。通过 Aerospace 的应用绑定规则和 Hammerspoon 的预设脚本，这套体系可以完全写入 dotfiles，在任何新设备上一键恢复。关键洞察是：与其让窗口布局依赖于你的手动操作记忆，不如让它成为可声明、可版本控制、可自动化的基础设施。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"多显示器与工作流编排","id":"多显示器与工作流编排"},{"level":2,"text":"概述","id":"概述"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":3,"text":"屏幕角色分配模型","id":"屏幕角色分配模型"},{"level":3,"text":"工作区预设概念","id":"工作区预设概念"},{"level":3,"text":"macOS 多显示器行为","id":"macos-多显示器行为"},{"level":2,"text":"实战指南","id":"实战指南"},{"level":3,"text":"Aerospace 多显示器配置","id":"aerospace-多显示器配置"},{"level":3,"text":"Hammerspoon 工作区预设","id":"hammerspoon-工作区预设"},{"level":3,"text":"Focus Mode 联动","id":"focus-mode-联动"},{"level":3,"text":"单显示器最佳实践","id":"单显示器最佳实践"},{"level":2,"text":"最佳实践","id":"最佳实践"},{"level":3,"text":"显示器选购建议（开发者视角）","id":"显示器选购建议-开发者视角"},{"level":3,"text":"竖屏使用场景","id":"竖屏使用场景"},{"level":3,"text":"布局方案版本控制","id":"布局方案版本控制"},{"level":3,"text":"环境感知自动切换","id":"环境感知自动切换"},{"level":2,"text":"工具与生态","id":"工具与生态"},{"level":3,"text":"显示器管理工具","id":"显示器管理工具"},{"level":3,"text":"工作流编排参考","id":"工作流编排参考"},{"level":2,"text":"总结","id":"总结"}],"prev":{"title":"快捷键体系设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-systems/developer-toolbox/workspace-productivity/keyboard-shortcut-system-design"},"next":null}